Z||000004||hugh||07-19-2001||08:35 PM||||With those batteries,I replace the original bolt with a 3/8th standard bolt with a nut wound all the way up that has enough threads so that I can bottom it in the battery by hand and then tighten the nut.Works perfect! ||||reg||1
